    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "西伐劉毅，使超石率步騎出江陵，未至而毅平。",
      "reading": "西討劉毅時超石未到江陵而毅已平。",
