      "end_codepoint": 87,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "義熙十二年北伐，超石為前鋒入河，索虜托跋嗣，姚興之壻也，遣弟黃門郎鵞青、冀州刺史安平公乙旃眷、襄州刺史托跋道生、青州刺史阿薄干，步騎十萬，屯河北，常有數千騎，緣河隨大軍進止。",
      "reading": "義熙十二年始北伐，見魏明元婚姻問及諸將名號，詳列南北人名對讀。",
      "note": "義熙十二年始北伐，見魏明元婚姻問及諸將名號，詳列南北人名對讀。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 87,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-87",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "時軍人緣河南岸，牽百丈，河流迅急，有漂渡北岸者，輒為虜所殺略。",
      "reading": "敘晉軍挽舟時的死傷。",
      "note": "敘晉軍挽舟時的死傷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 87,
      "end_codepoint": 118,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-118",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "遣軍裁過岸，虜便退走，軍還，即復東來。",
      "reading": "敘河兩岸兩軍進退。",
      "note": "敘河兩岸兩軍進退。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 118,
      "end_codepoint": 137,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
