    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-316",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "於是百弩俱發，又選善射者叢箭射之，虜眾既多，弩不能制。",
      "reading": "敘接戰狀況，固定本補弩字。",
      "note": "敘接戰狀況，固定本補弩字。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 316,
      "end_codepoint": 343,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-343",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "超石初行，別齎大鎚并千餘張矟，乃斷矟長三四尺，以鎚鎚之，一矟輒洞貫三四虜。",
      "reading": "傳記超石軍作戰與殺傷。",
      "note": "傳記超石軍作戰與殺傷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 343,
      "end_codepoint": 380,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-380",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "虜眾不能當，一時奔潰，臨陣斬阿薄干首，虜退還半城。",
      "reading": "阿薄干死，魏兵退半城，殿本作平城。",
      "note": "阿薄干死，魏兵退半城，殿本作平城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 380,
      "end_codepoint": 405,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-405",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "超石率胡藩、劉榮祖等追之，復為虜所圍，奮擊盡日，殺虜千計，虜乃退走。",
      "reading": "超石與胡藩、劉榮祖等追，戰後魏兵退。",
      "note": "超石與胡藩、劉榮祖等追，戰後魏兵退。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 405,
      "end_codepoint": 439,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-439",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "高祖又遣振武將軍徐猗之五千人向越騎城，虜圍猗之，以長戟結陣，超石赴之，未至悉奔走。",
      "reading": "劉裕又遣徐猗之向越騎城，超石未至圍已解。",
      "note": "劉裕又遣徐猗之向越騎城，超石未至圍已解。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 439,
      "end_codepoint": 480,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-480",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "大軍進克蒲坂，以超石為河東太守，戍守之。",
      "reading": "克蒲坂，超石任河東太守。",
      "note": "克蒲坂，超石任河東太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 480,
      "end_codepoint": 500,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence3-500",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "賊以超石眾少，復還攻城，超石戰敗退走，數日乃及大軍。",
      "reading": "守蒲坂失利，數日後與主力會合。",
      "note": "守蒲坂失利，數日後與主力會合。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 500,
      "end_codepoint": 526,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-zhuchaoshi:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "92a_026_432",
      "source_quote": "高祖自長安東還，超石常令人水道至彭城，除中書侍郎，封興平縣五等侯。",
      "reading": "劉裕東還，超石受中書侍郎、興平縣五等侯之命。",
      "note": "劉裕東還，超石受中書侍郎、興平縣五等侯之命。",
